msgid "comp7_aggressive_detection/descr/active"
msgstr ""
"The view range will be increased by {colorTagOpen}%(visionBuff_1)s/%(visionBuff_2)s/%(visionBuff_3)s%%{colorTagClose} for {colorTagOpen}%(duration)s s{colorTagClose}.\n"
"\n"
"The timer will reset when an enemy vehicle is destroyed upon your spotting."

msgid "comp7_aggressive_detection/name"
msgstr "Active Recon"

msgid "comp7_ally_support/descr/active"
msgstr ""
"For {colorTagOpen}%(duration)s s{colorTagClose}, your crew receives a {colorTagOpen}%(crewBuff_1)s/%(crewBuff_2)s/%(crewBuff_3)s%%{colorTagClose} bonus to efficiency for each vehicle on your team with a different role.\n"
"\n"
"Your vehicle will always be included in the calculation of this bonus."

msgid "comp7_ally_support/name"
msgstr "One for All"

msgid "comp7_aoe_heal/descr/active"
msgstr ""
"For {colorTagOpen}%(duration)s s{colorTagClose}, an area with a radius of "
"{colorTagOpen}%(radius)s m{colorTagClose} is created around your vehicle "
"that restores {colorTagOpen}%(heal_1)s/%(heal_2)s/%(heal_3)s{colorTagClose} "
"hit points for your vehicle and allied vehicles."

msgid "comp7_aoe_heal/name"
msgstr "Field Repairs"

msgid "comp7_aoe_inspire/descr/active"
msgstr ""
"For {colorTagOpen}%(duration)s s{colorTagClose}, your crew and allied crews "
"receive a "
"{colorTagOpen}%(crewBuff_1)s/%(crewBuff_2)s/%(crewBuff_3)s%%{colorTagClose} "
"bonus to efficiency."

msgid "comp7_aoe_inspire/name"
msgstr "Inspire"

msgid "comp7_berserk/descr/active"
msgstr ""
"For {colorTagOpen}%(duration)s s{colorTagClose}, the gun reload time is reduced by {colorTagOpen}%(gunReloadTimeBuff_1)s/%(gunReloadTimeBuff_2)s/%(gunReloadTimeBuff_3)s%%{colorTagClose}. Also, gun dispersion after firing, during movement, and during hull and turret traverse is reduced by {colorTagOpen}%(shotDispersionFactorsBuff_1)s/%(shotDispersionFactorsBuff_2)s/%(shotDispersionFactorsBuff_3)s%%{colorTagClose}.\n"
"\n"
"The timer will reset when you cause damage by ramming or shooting from a distance of under {colorTagOpen}%(damageDistance)s m{colorTagClose}."

msgid "comp7_berserk/name"
msgstr "Fury"

msgid "comp7_concentration/descr/active"
msgstr ""
"For {colorTagOpen}%(duration)s s{colorTagClose}, aiming time and gun dispersion during movement, hull traverse, and turret traverse are reduced by {colorTagOpen}%(shotDispersionFactorsBuff_1)s/%(shotDispersionFactorsBuff_2)s/%(shotDispersionFactorsBuff_3)s%%{colorTagClose}.\n"
"\n"
"While this Role Skill is active, the reload time between shots is reduced by {colorTagOpen}%(clipReloadTimeBoost_1)s/%(clipReloadTimeBoost_2)s/%(clipReloadTimeBoost_3)s s{colorTagClose}."

msgid "comp7_concentration/name"
msgstr "Focus on the Target"

msgid "comp7_fast_recharge/descr/active"
msgstr ""
"For a magazine loading system:\n"
"\n"
"The remaining magazine reload time is reduced by {colorTagOpen}%(gunReloadTimeBuff_1)s/%(gunReloadTimeBuff_2)s/%(gunReloadTimeBuff_3)s%%{colorTagClose}.\n"
"\n"
"For an autoreloading system:\n"
"\n"
"All fired shells in the current cycle will be reloaded {colorTagOpen}%(gunReloadTimeBuff_1)s/%(gunReloadTimeBuff_2)s/%(gunReloadTimeBuff_3)s%%{colorTagClose} faster.\n"
"\n"
"This skill can only be activated during the reloading process."

msgid "comp7_fast_recharge/name"
msgstr "Sleight of Hand"

msgid "comp7_hunter/descr/active"
msgstr ""
"Resets the number of enemy vehicles damaged by shots.\n"
"\n"
"For {colorTagOpen}%(duration)s s{colorTagClose}, your vehicle will restore {colorTagOpen}%(heal_1)s/%(heal_2)s/%(heal_3)s{colorTagClose} hit points for each enemy vehicle damaged by a shot at the moment of activation."

msgid "comp7_hunter/descr/passive"
msgstr ""
"Gun reload time is reduced by "
"{colorTagOpen}%(gunReloadTimeBuff)s%%{colorTagClose} for each enemy vehicle "
"damaged by a shot."

msgid "comp7_hunter/name"
msgstr "Bounty Hunter"

msgid "comp7_juggernaut/descr/active"
msgstr ""
"For {colorTagOpen}%(duration_1)s/%(duration_2)s/%(duration_3)s s{colorTagClose}:\n"
"• Incoming damage is reduced by {colorTagOpen}%(dmgAbsorbBuff_1)s/%(dmgAbsorbBuff_2)s/%(dmgAbsorbBuff_3)s%%{colorTagClose}\n"
"• Top forward speed is increased by {colorTagOpen}%(fwMaxSpeedBonus)s km/h{colorTagClose}\n"
"• Top reverse speed is increased by {colorTagOpen}%(bkMaxSpeedBonus)s km/h{colorTagClose}\n"
"• Engine power is increased by {colorTagOpen}%(enginePowerBuff)s%%{colorTagClose}\n"
"• Damage from ramming to enemy vehicles is increased by {colorTagOpen}%(rammingDamageBuff)s%%{colorTagClose}\n"
"\n"
"When this Role Skill is active, your tracks will be destroyed by a single shot."

msgid "comp7_juggernaut/name"
msgstr "Juggernaut"

msgid "comp7_march/descr/active"
msgstr ""
"For {colorTagOpen}%(duration_1)s/%(duration_2)s/%(duration_3)s "
"s{colorTagClose}, your vehicle's engine power will increase by "
"{colorTagOpen}%(enginePowerBuff)s%%{colorTagClose}, its top forward speed "
"will increase by {colorTagOpen}%(fwdSpeedBoost)s{colorTagClose} km/h, and "
"its concealment value will increase by "
"{colorTagOpen}%(invisibilityFactor)s%%{colorTagClose}."

msgid "comp7_march/name"
msgstr "Forced March"

msgid "comp7_recon/descr/active"
msgstr ""
"A recon aircraft will fly over the selected area within {colorTagOpen}%(delay)s s{colorTagClose}. Enemy vehicles detected within a radius of {colorTagOpen}%(radius_1)s/%(radius_2)s/%(radius_3)s m{colorTagClose} remain spotted for {colorTagOpen}%(duration_1)s/%(duration_2)s/%(duration_3)s&nbsp;s{colorTagClose}. A separate icon will be displayed for a player detected by this skill with a {colorTagOpen}%(lampDelay)s s{colorTagClose} delay.\n"
"\n"
"This skill becomes available for use {colorTagOpen}%(startupDelay)s s{colorTagClose} seconds after the battle starts."

msgid "comp7_recon/name"
msgstr "Recon Flight"

msgid "comp7_redline/descr/active"
msgstr ""
"The selected area will be attacked by an artillery strike within {colorTagOpen}%(delay)s s{colorTagClose}.\n"
"\n"
"The targets damaged within a radius of {colorTagOpen}%(radius_1)s/%(radius_2)s/%(radius_3)s m{colorTagClose} will receive {colorTagOpen}%(damage_1)s/%(damage_2)s/%(damage_3)s{colorTagClose} HP of damage and will be stunned for {colorTagOpen}%(stunDuration_1)s/%(stunDuration_2)s/%(stunDuration_3)s s{colorTagClose}."

msgid "comp7_redline/name"
msgstr "Fire Cover"

msgid "comp7_risky_attack/descr/active"
msgstr ""
"Acceleration\n"
"\n"
"For {colorTagOpen}%(duration)s s{colorTagClose}, engine power increases by {colorTagOpen}%(enginePowerBuff)s%%{colorTagClose}, the top forward speed increases by {colorTagOpen}%(fwdSpeedBoost)s{colorTagClose} km/h, and the top reverse speed increases by {colorTagOpen}%(bkwSpeedBoost)s{colorTagClose} km/h.\n"
"\n"
"Recovery\n"
"\n"
"For {colorTagOpen}%(healDuration)s s{colorTagClose}, your vehicle restores {colorTagOpen}%(baseHeal)s{colorTagClose} hit points {colorTagOpen}+%(extraHealFactor_1)s/%(extraHealFactor_2)s/%(extraHealFactor_3)s%%{colorTagClose} of hit points lost while Acceleration is active."

msgid "comp7_risky_attack/name"
msgstr "Second Wind"

msgid "comp7_role_skill/descr/startLevel"
msgstr ""
" \n"
"\n"
"At the beginning of a battle, the charge level of the Role Skill is{colorTagOpen} %(startLevel)s{colorTagClose}."

msgid "comp7_sniper/descr/active"
msgstr ""
"For {colorTagOpen}%(duration_1)s/%(duration_2)s/%(duration_3)s s{colorTagClose}, dispersion at 100 m is equal to {colorTagOpen}%(dispersionFactor)s m{colorTagClose}.\n"
"\n"
"If your vehicle has not been spotted at the moment of the shot, the damage caused with your shell will increase by {colorTagOpen}%(damageFactors_1)s/%(damageFactors_2)s/%(damageFactors_3)s%%{colorTagClose}. \n"
"\n"
"The timer will be reset for damage caused by shooting from a distance of over {colorTagOpen}%(damageDistance)s m{colorTagClose}."

msgid "comp7_sniper/name"
msgstr "Bullseye"

msgid "comp7_sure_shot/descr/active"
msgstr ""
"For {colorTagOpen}%(duration)s s{colorTagClose}, gun dispersion during movement, hull traverse, and turret traverse is reduced by {colorTagOpen}%(shotDispersionFactorsBuff_1)s/%(shotDispersionFactorsBuff_2)s/%(shotDispersionFactorsBuff_3)s%%{colorTagClose}.\n"
"\n"
"While this skill is active, damage by shooting reduces gun reload time by {colorTagOpen}%(gunReloadBuffDamage_1)s/%(gunReloadBuffDamage_2)s/%(gunReloadBuffDamage_3)s%%{colorTagClose} of the percentage by which the enemy vehicle's hit points have decreased.\n"
"\n"
"Destroying an enemy vehicle reduces gun reload time by {colorTagOpen}%(gunReloadBuffDestroy_1)s/%(gunReloadBuffDestroy_2)s/%(gunReloadBuffDestroy_3)s%%{colorTagClose}."

msgid "comp7_sure_shot/name"
msgstr "Clean Shot"
